@startuml sequence_mode_toggle
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title Goal Metrics - Mode toggle without remount

actor User
participant "DashboardPage" as Page
participant "Tile" as T
participant "Controller" as C
participant "API" as API
participant "Hub" as H

User -> Page: Click "Review"
Page -> T: mode() signal flips
T -> H: unsubscribe goalProgressUpdated
T -> C: load('review', selectedReviewDate)
C -> API: GET /goal-progress/at?asOf
C -> API: GET /goal-progress/current
API --> C: historical { count: 8, target: 30 }
API --> C: current { count: 12, target: 30 }
C --> T: signals (REVIEW pill, ring 27%, delta '-4 vs today')
note over T: Same DOM host, same instanceId
T --> User: Tile shows historical view
== back to Live ==
User -> Page: Click "Live"
Page -> T: mode() flips
T -> C: load('live', null)
C -> API: GET /goal-progress/current
API --> C: { count: 12 }
T -> H: subscribe goalProgressUpdated
T --> User: LIVE pill, no delta

@enduml
